      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Parameters",
      "contextAfter": "`delegate`: The delegate object for the connection. The connection calls methods on this delegate as the load progresses. Delegate methods are called on the same thread that called this method. By default, for the connection to work correctly, the calling thread’s run loop must be operating in the default run loop mode. See [`schedule(in:forMode:)`](nsurlconnection/schedule(in:formode:).md) to change the run loop and mode.",
